    "https://www.neiu.edu/student-life/current-students/career-development": {
      "title": "Menu Audience",
      "description": "Career Development | NEIU Skip to main content Admissions Learn About NEIU Visit Us Our Programs Requirements Admitted Students Your Success Profile Graduate Studies Continue Your Education Parents and Family Resources Financial Aid Tuition & Fees Tuition Information Fees Information Calculating Your Net Cost Scholarship Opportunities Scholarship Listing Applying for Federal & State Assistance Documents Summer Financial Aid Resources Financial Aid Forms & Documents Resources Applying for Student Loans Student Employment Opportunities Student Payment Services Academics Taking Classes Class Schedules & Registration Academic Calendar Advising Center Majors, Minors, Graduate Programs & Certificates University Core Curriculum / General Education Community & Professional Education Academic Units All Academic Departments College of Arts & Sciences College of Business & Technology Daniel L. Goodwin College of Education College of Graduate Studies & Research Nontraditional Degree Programs Carruthers Center for Inner City Studies El Centro University Center of Lake County Center for College Access and Success First-Year Experience Our Centers and Programs Opportunities International Programs Research Resources McNair Scholars University Honors Program Student Center for Science Engagement Intensive English Program Resources Center for Teaching and Learning Registrar Services Transcripts Academic Catalog Student Achievement Information Assessment University Life Things To Do Academic Calendar Campus Recreation Student Union Arts at Northeastern Box Office Student Leadership & Organizations Support Learning Success Center TRIO Student Support Services Project Success Proyecto Pa’Lante Student Affairs Dean of Students Advising Center Student Success and Retention Services All Student Resources Student Counseling Services Career Development Student Health Services Student Disability Services Veterans Services Parking University Police Bookstore Child Care Center Technology Services Event & Conference Services Immigration Enforcement Actions Resources Library Pedroso Center Undocumented Student Resources Black Student Success Committee Title IX New Student Resources Guide BIG Center Living on Campus Student Housing Living Learning Communities Alumni & Giving Alumni Your Membership Alumni Events Office of Alumni Relations Giving Giving Opportunities Impact of Your Gift Scholarships Foundation Meet Our Staff Transforming Lives About Who We Are Northeastern News Facts & Distinctions Community & Visitor Guide Northeastern History Mission, Vision and Values Strategic Planning Accreditation Office of Institutional Research & Assessment Our Leadership University Leadership President Executive Team Shared Governance Board of Trustees Employment Working Here Resources Brand Guide Complaints Northeastern Neighbors Legal Menu Audience Menu Audience Placeholder What can we help you find? Menu Actions Menu Actions Give Now Request Info Visit Apply Office of Career Development Home — University Life — Current Students — \n                                Welcome to the Office of Career Development Career Development Career Development Choosing a Major/Career - Career Advising Career Development Events Previous Event Highlights Career, Internship, and Job Fairs Spring 2026 Career Fair Internships Featured Internships by Major Internship & Career Resources Digital Library Graduate School Planning Power Closet Donations Student Success Stories Information for Employers Inclusive Career & Community Resources LGBTQ+ Career Development & Resources Contact Us Welcome to the Office of Career Development! We are here to empower you to explore, prepare, and achieve your career goals. Whether you’re deciding on a major, seeking your first job, or advancing in your professional journey, we provide the tools, resources, and support to help you succeed. The Office of Career Development proudly serves NEIU students and alumni , offering individual appointments, career assessments, and opportunities to connect with employers and industry professionals. Our mission is to help you build confidence, make informed decisions, and successfully transition from college to career. We provide a wide range of career resources and professional services, including: Major & Career Exploration Discover career paths that match your strengths, interests, and values. Career Preparation Get personalized guidance with resumes, cover letters, and interview practice. Networking & Job Search Learn effective strategies, connect with employers, and grow your professional network. Events & Workshops Participate in career fairs, employer spotlights, and skill-building webinars. Power Closet Access FREE professional attire to feel confident in interviews and career opportunities. Appointment Scheduling & Handshake Schedule an Appointment Meet with a Career Development staff member in person or virtually through your Handshake account. How to Schedule an Appointment Log in with your NEIUport credentials and NEIU email When you log in, click on \"Northeastern Illinois University Career Center.\" Next, click on the “Appointments” tab. Then, click on \"Schedule a New Appointment.\" Choose your category and appointment type, then the times and dates of our Career Advisors will pop up. Appointments are both virtual and in-person. If you need help, contact us at (773) 442-4680 or ocs@neiu.edu . About Handshake Handshake is NEIU’s career development platform—your one-stop hub for jobs, events, and employer connections. With more than 7 million students and 500,000+ employers, it’s the #1 platform for career opportunities. Through Handshake you can: Get personalized job and internship recommendations based on your major and interests Register for career fairs and networking events (on-campus, off-campus, and nationwide) Manage on-campus interviews with top companies and connect directly with employers Schedule appointments with your career coordinator Questions? Contact us at (773) 442-4680 or ocs@neiu.edu . Visit Us! The Career Development office is located in Room B 119 and open Monday–Friday, 8:30 a.m. – 4:30 p.m. If there are any questions or concerns, please contact NEIU Career Development at (773) 442-4680 or ocs@neiu.edu Quick Links Handshake Contact Career Development Center T (773) 442-4680 ocs@neiu.edu Contact Us Connect with Career Development Center Our Mission is You Request Information Plan a Visit Apply Now Footer Menu 1 Footer Menu 1 Online Learning Academic Calendar NEIUPort Maps & Directions Housing Events Employment Directory Community Library Main Campus 5500 North St. Louis Avenue Chicago, IL 60625 (773) 583-4050 Carruthers Center 700 East Oakwood Blvd. Chicago, IL 60625 (773) 268-7500 El Centro 3390 North Avondale Ave. Chicago, IL 60618 (773) 442-4080 University Center 1200 University Center Drive, Room 220B Grayslake, IL 60030 (847) 665-4000 Footer bottom Footer bottom Take a Virtual Tour Give to NEIU © 2022 Northeastern Illinois University | Legal | Login Also of Interest CBT Career Services Mathematics Development Information for Employers ↑"
    },
