ions College of Education Faculty Positions Library Faculty Positions Northeastern Illinois University is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer and invites applications from Women, Minorities, Veterans and Persons with Disabilities, as well as other qualified individuals. Northeastern Illinois University's positions are contingent upon the University's receipt of its State of Illinois appropriation. A & P Jobs Administrative and Professional Employment Opportunities Civil Service Jobs Join a team of civil services here Extra Help Employment Opportunities Join the NEIU team. Contact Human Resources T (773) 442-5200 F (773) 442-5220 hr-office@neiu.edu Contact Human Resources Our Mission is You Request Information Plan a Visit Apply Now Footer Menu 1 Footer Menu 1 Online Learning Academic Calendar NEIUPort Maps & Directions Housing Events Employment Directory Community Library Main Campus 5500 North St. Louis Avenue Chicago, IL 60625 (773) 583-4050 Carruthers Center 700 East Oakwood Blvd. Chicago, IL 60625 (773) 268-7500 El Centro 3390 North Avondale Ave. Chicago, IL 60618 (773) 442-4080 University Center 1200 University Center Drive, Room 220B Grayslake, IL 60030 (847) 665-4000 Footer bottom Footer bottom Take a Virtual Tour Give to NEIU © 2022 Northeastern Illinois University | Legal | Login Also of Interest Extra Help Employment Opportunities CBT Faculty Employment Opportunities Student Employment Opportunities ↑"
