30 p.m. Monday through Friday. Questions? Call (773) 442-5200 Employment Services reserves the right not to consider any application on the basis of: incomplete information/documents delay in submission not meeting minimal qualifications Be assured, your application will be reviewed on the basis of the position(s) in which you qualify and we will inform you of our decision. For more job opportunities, check Working Here on the NEIU website. Northeastern Illinois University is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer and invites applications from Women, Minorities, Veterans and Persons with Disabilities, as well as other qualified individuals. Northeastern Illinois University positions are contingent upon the University’s receipt of its State of Illinois appropriation. Contact College of Business and Technology T (773) 442-6104 F (773) 442-6110 cbt-do@neiu.edu Contact Us Connect with College of Business and Technology Our Mission is You Request Information Plan a Visit Apply Now Footer Menu 1 Footer Menu 1 Online Learning Academic Calendar NEIUPort Maps & Directions Housing Events Employment Directory Community Library Main Campus 5500 North St. Louis Avenue Chicago, IL 60625 (773) 583-4050 Carruthers Center 700 East Oakwood Blvd. Chicago, IL 60625 (773) 268-7500 El Centro 3390 North Avondale Ave. Chicago, IL 60618 (773) 442-4080 University Center 1200 University Center Drive, Room 220B Grayslake, IL 60030 (847) 665-4000 Footer bottom Footer bottom Take a Virtual Tour Give to NEIU © 2022 Northeastern Illinois University | Legal | Login Also of Interest Faculty Employment Opportunities Significant Contributors of CBT Student Employment Opportunities ↑"
